    "regime_notes": "Raw signal IC was -0.043410 with ICIR -0.135033; sign-reversed admission signal passes the benchmark gates. Regime raw ICs were +0.0207 (2020-2021), -0.0056 (2022-2023), +0.0104 (2024-2025), and -0.0475 (2026-2027), so the reversed effect is strongest recently but is regime-dependent. The 15-instrument cross-section and 4,082 date-level observations warrant conservative weighting.",
